{"id":10126,"name":"lycanroc-midnight","speciesId":745,"dex":745,"form":"other","generation":7,"types":["rock"],"stats":{"hp":85,"attack":115,"defense":75,"special-attack":55,"special-defense":75,"speed":82},"abilities":[{"name":"keen-eye","hidden":false},{"name":"vital-spirit","hidden":false},{"name":"no-guard","hidden":true}],"height":11,"weight":250,"baseExp":170,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10126.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/10126.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10126.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/10126.ogg","genus":"Wolf Pokémon","flavor":[{"version":"sun","text":"Its quick movements confuse its enemies. Well equipped with claws and fangs, it also uses the sharp rocks in its mane as weapons."},{"version":"moon","text":"When properly raised from a young age, it will become a trustworthy partner that will absolutely never betray its Trainer."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"The sharp rocks in its mane can cut like knives. Lycanroc wears its prey down by degrees before finishing them off."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"The rocks in its mane are sharper than a knife. Fragments that break off are treasured as good luck charms."},{"version":"sword","text":"This Lycanroc is calm and cautious. The rocks jutting from its mane are razor sharp."},{"version":"shield","text":"With swift movements, this Pokémon gradually backs its prey into a corner. Lycanroc’s fangs are always aimed toward opponents’ weak spots."}],"genderRate":4,"captureRate":90,"eggGroups":["ground"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"rockruff","speciesId":744,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Nível 25, De dia","Nível 25, À noite","Nível 25, À noite"],"species":"lycanroc","speciesId":745,"evolvesTo"